---
source: crates/cli/tests/init.rs
expression: "format!(\"{yaml}---\\n{}\", text(&out.stdout))"
---
# Generated by `sudsy init --from eslint`; review before use.
extends:
  - preset:js/eslint-recommended
  - preset:js/typescript-eslint-recommended
exclude: [dist/, build/]
js:
  lint:
    rules:
      no-debugger: "off"
      no-explicit-any: warn
      undefined-variable:
        level: error
        options:
          globals: [jQuery]
      unused-parameter: warn
      unused-variable: warn
json:
  format:
    array_bracket_spacing: true
    bracket_spacing: false
    indent_style: tab
    trailing_commas: multiline
  lint:
    rules:
      key-name-casing:
        level: error
        options:
          allowed: [snake_case]
          ignored_keys: ["^\\$"]
      no-duplicate-keys: "off"
      sorted-array-values: warn
      sorted-keys:
        level: error
        options:
          blank_line_groups: true
          direction: desc
          min_keys: 3
---
migrated .eslintrc.json
extends: preset:js/eslint-recommended
extends: preset:js/typescript-eslint-recommended
not migrated: airbnb (a shared config is not followed; its rules are not migrated)
not migrated: import/order (a plugin Sudsy has no equivalent for)
not migrated: no-console (planned)
not migrated: no-floating-promises (needs type information from the TypeScript worker (`recommended-type-checked` and the stylistic type-checked rules))
not migrated: jsonc/no-comments (syntax errors are always reported)
not migrated: jsonc/not-a-rule (not an eslint-plugin-jsonc rule Sudsy knows)
not migrated: jsonc/object-curly-newline (no `minProperties`/`multiline` threshold: `collapse` follows source line breaks and fit, not property count)
not migrated: jsonc/sort-array-values options (per-path option sets are not supported; set the options by hand)
not migrated: !build/keep.js (negated ignore patterns are not supported)
